        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Pero Set cazaba de noche, y esa noche brillaba la luna llena.",
          "en": "But Set hunted by night, and that night the moon was full."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entre los juncos descubrió el cofre, y lo abrió.",
          "en": "Among the reeds he found the chest, and he opened it."
        },
        {
          "es": "Al reconocer el cuerpo de su hermano, la rabia lo cegó.",
          "en": "When he recognized his brother’s body, rage blinded him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Lo despedazó en catorce partes y las dispersó por todo Egipto, para que nadie pudiera volver a juntarlas.",
          "en": "He tore it into fourteen pieces and scattered them across all of Egypt, so that no one could ever put them back together."
        }
      ],
